// CoffeeMan / Amigo (coffeeman.co.il), Israel — Lavazza Crema e Gusto Classico ground in a
// vacuum brick: a single 250 g pack plus the 4 × 250 g (SKU 930334) and 8 × 250 g (SKU 930335)
